WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.200
Meet Mitra Home. Your family's bills, papers, money and calendar, kept on your own computer.

2
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:13.100
Open it on your PC, and Today shows what needs you: what's late, what's due, and what's coming this week.

3
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:21.400
Drop in a bill, a statement or a school letter. Mitra files it, and pulls out the dates and amounts, with the AI you choose.

4
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.700
Everyone's appointments, classes, school days off and holidays, in one family calendar.

5
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:35.400
Money works like your bank: every account, card, investment and loan, with what you have, what you owe, and your net worth.

6
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.900
See where the money went each month, against last month and last year.

7
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:48.300
Family keeps each person's records, the cars, IDs and insurance, and a wallet for the numbers you always look for.

8
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:58.200
The free phone app, for Android and iPhone, pairs with your PC on home Wi-Fi. Check today, mark a bill paid, or add an event on the go.

9
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:06.100
Turn an old tablet into the Mitra Wall: the family's week at a glance, the kids' jobs and stars, and what's for dinner.

10
00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:14.700
When no one is using it, it becomes Mitra Clock. Pick a face, add your photos, and at night it dims to a soft bedside clock.

11
00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:23.900
No subscription, and your records never leave home. Mitra Home is free and open source. Try the demo on our website.
